cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite it as below."
title: "rust-vs-jvm-runtime-tax: benchmark artifact for Quantifying the Runtime Tax"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible benchmark comparing a native Rust pipeline and a standalone
  Scala 3 (JVM) pipeline on an identical uncompressed Parquet workload under
  identical cgroup resource limits, measuring CPU-seconds, peak anonymous
  memory, per-batch latency, GC pauses and modeled cloud cost.
type: software
authors:
